## Module Overview

The project has 5 network-related modules under `core/`:

```
core/
  coreNetworkApi/          — Pure interface + domain models (no engine)
  coreNetworkKtor/         — Ktor implementation, Koin wiring
  coreNetworkStub/         — In-memory stub for previews/testing
  coreNetworkDebugEmpty/   — No-op configureHttpClientDebug() for release
  coreNetworkDebugLogs/    — Full logging configureHttpClientDebug() for debug
```

