## 1. `coreNetworkApi` — API Interface Module

### `build.gradle.kts`
```kotlin
plugins {
    id("composeMultiplatformConvention")
}

kotlin.androidLibrary.namespace = "siarhei.luskanau.pixabayeye.core.network.api"
