## 3. `coreNetworkStub` — Stub Module

### `build.gradle.kts`
```kotlin
plugins {
    id("composeMultiplatformConvention")
}

kotlin.androidLibrary.namespace = "siarhei.luskanau.pixabayeye.core.network.stub"

