## 4. Debug Modules — `configureHttpClientDebug()` Pattern

Both modules define the same function signature so `PixabayApiClient.kt` calls it without any conditionals in Kotlin code. The selection is at Gradle dependency level.

### `coreNetworkDebugEmpty/` — release variant
```kotlin
// commonMain only, no platform splits
fun <T : HttpClientEngineConfig> HttpClientConfig<T>.configureHttpClientDebug() {
    // no logs and debug in production
}
```

### `coreNetworkDebugLogs/build.gradle.kts`
```kotlin
plugins {
    id("composeMultiplatformConvention")
}

kotlin {
    androidLibrary.namespace = "siarhei.luskanau.pixabayeye.core.network.debug.logs"
    sourceSets {
        commonMain.dependencies {
            implementation(libs.ktor.client.logging)  // io.ktor:ktor-client-logging
        }
