## 5. `coreStubResources` — Shared Stub Data

Lives in `commonMain` and uses `Res.getUri()` from Compose Multiplatform resources to point to actual local asset files (images and video files bundled in `composeResources/drawable/`):

```kotlin
val TYPES_IMAGE = listOf("photo", "illustration")
val TYPES_VIDEO = listOf("video", "animation")
val HIT_LIST = listOf(
    HitModel(id = 9767930, type = "photo", /* ... */
        imageModel = ImageHitModel(
            previewUrl = Res.getUri("drawable/milky-way-9767930_150.jpg"), ...
        )
    ),
    HitModel(id = 186714, type = "animation", /* ... */
        videosModel = mapOf(
            "large" to VideoHitModel(url = Res.getUri("drawable/186714-878826932_large.mp4"), ...),
            ...
        )
    )
)
```

